The tension comes from the arrangement\'92s short life. Every encounter might be with someone who has seen the broadcast, received a message or spoken to someone from the auditorium. Bala\'92s value is knowing how to keep them moving without becoming entangled in explanations.\
Sarah\'92s leverage is Alexander\'92s desire to believe she wants him with her. She can give him something immediate to do\'97come along, help her, leave the explanations until they arrive\'97without forgiving him or endorsing his account. He supplies his own flattering interpretation.\
